OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' as he
OL,4,Aaddresses Macklemore controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger Ed Sheeran opened his latest
OL,7,Fconcert alone onstage and apologised to
OL,8,Fhis fans for making "mistakes" as he
OL,9,Fhandled the fallout from the
OL,10,Fcontroversy over American rapper
OL,11,FMacklemore being dropped from his tour
OL,12,Fover pro-Palestinian remarks.
OL,14,F"I never wanted to be an activist
OL,15,Fmusician but this has put me in the
OL,16,Fmiddle of an important and passionate
OL,17,Fargument about free speech and the most
OL,18,Fcomplex political issue on the planet,"
OL,19,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
