OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' as he
OL,4,Aaddresses Macklemore controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaturday's show at a Philadelphia
OL,7,Fsports stadium was the first time he
OL,8,Fhas addressed the matter in person.
OL,10,FIt was a stripped down event and
OL,11,FSheeran went on without opening acts
OL,12,Fafter several musicians dropped out
OL,13,Fover the debacle.
